# Design specs live here (see ../README.md).
#
# This file exists because git cannot track an empty directory. Twenty-one spec
# numbers the ledger schedules -- 036-045 (video pipeline) and 057-063 (core
# pages) -- have no directory in this repository at all, and `git log --all
# --diff-filter=A -- specs/036*` returns nothing: they were folders only, so
# they never entered a commit. A .gitkeep is the whole fix.
